        <item>
            <title>Version 0.0.2</title>
            <description>
                <![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>Apple-style artwork glow and smooth notch transitions.</li>
                    <li>AirPods hardware controls (Noise Cancellation, Transparency, Adaptive).</li>
                    <li>Hardware brightness and volume sliders with instantaneous responsiveness.</li>
